138 = 0.014 is below 0.08), and no POL-NS-09 trigger fires: no admissible artifacts contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence, disputes_with_counterparty_90d is 0 and 0, and rider no_show_disputes_30d is 0. The MISSING traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-02747-01 carries weight 0.0, carries no fact, and is relied on by neither side after the referee's discards. The mis-selected reason code is referred below as a driver-education item. Confidence is 0.95: the deciding facts — the reason code and the in-radius position — rest on EV-TRIP-02747 and EV-GPS-02747, both at weight_multiplier 1.0, so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.0 and no impairment discount applies.",
